From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mpc823 <11076149+mpc823@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 16:05:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] scan: report unique dynamic transponder progress

NIT discovery replaces the pending scan list. Do not accumulate each
replacement in the total, otherwise the UI reports a fictitious transponder
count and appears to jump near the end of the scan.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [project-specific progress semantics]

---
 src/zapit/src/scan.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/zapit/src/scan.cpp b/src/zapit/src/scan.cpp
index f919dfaf8..000000000 100644
--- a/src/zapit/src/scan.cpp
+++ b/src/zapit/src/scan.cpp
@@ -253,3 +253,3 @@
 _repeat:
-	found_transponders += scantransponders.size();
+	found_transponders = processed_transponders + scantransponders.size();
 	CZapit::getInstance()->SendEvent ( CZapitClient::EVT_SCAN_NUM_TRANSPONDERS,
